# A removal must be narrowed before it is used

Verifies the nullable element a removal produces cannot take part in
arithmetic until a null check has narrowed it.

>>> source
let values: int[] = [1]
let total = values->pop() + 1

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: nullable value must be narrowed before this operation at Span { start: 36, end: 49 }

<<< exit
1
